{"chunk_id": "SYN-NORM-RANGE", "text": "以任务清单显式选定的规格RevB为准，不按文件名猜最新版。模拟任务日期2024-06-30，收件时间2026-10-26。\n仅A1、C1的5 V输出角色。每个端口独立核对下列5项，共10项。\n本文件只规定如何核对已有记录，不提供短路实验操作步骤。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-QA-SC-1.0.md", "page": null, "section": "DEMO-00", "version": "1.0", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "SYN-NORM-RESPONSE", "text": "保护响应时间应有明确数值、单位与记录ID，模拟阈值不大于500 ms。1 s = 1000 ms，不能直接比较0.68和500。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-QA-SC-1.0.md", "page": null, "section": "DEMO-01", "version": "1.0", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "SYN-NORM-RECOVERY", "text": "恢复电压依据已选规格SYN-SPEC-PB01-RevB的SPEC-REC，区间含两端。报告自带判定不能覆盖规格要求。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-QA-SC-1.0.md", "page": null, "section": "DEMO-02", "version": "1.0", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "SYN-SPEC-PB01-RevB-REC", "text": "模拟条款 SPEC-REC：保护后恢复电压范围 4.75 V 至 5.25 V，含边界。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-SPEC-PB01-RevB.md", "page": null, "section": "SPEC-REC 恢复电压", "version": "B", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "SYN-NORM-TEMP", "text": "按同一记录的末值减起值计算，模拟上限12 K；温差1摄氏度对应1 K。\n关键位模糊或缺失时不猜数字，不做超限与否的最终数值判断。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-QA-SC-1.0.md", "page": null, "section": "DEMO-03", "version": "1.0", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "SYN-NORM-APPEARANCE", "text": "每个端口分别有明确的无起火、无爆炸、无漏液记录。无文字或只有横线表示证据不足。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-QA-SC-1.0.md", "page": null, "section": "DEMO-04", "version": "1.0", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "SYN-NORM-METHOD", "text": "每个端口需有非空的恢复方式文字记录。记录缺失只能判证据不足，不能推定实验未执行。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-QA-SC-1.0.md", "page": null, "section": "DEMO-05", "version": "1.0", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "SYN-NORM-CONFLICT", "text": "摘要和原始记录矛盾时输出双方位置，待人工确认；不能静默挑一方作为已核实事实。\n可对清晰的记录做条件性比较，但冲突未决前不能形成最终通过结论。", "namespace": "requirement", "source_role": "selected_requirement", "source_path": "data/bootstrap-v0.1/knowledge/synthetic/SYN-QA-SC-1.0.md", "page": null, "section": "DEMO-06", "version": "1.0", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": null, "context_ids": []}
{"chunk_id": "D805-CONDITION", "text": "本报告测试条件：电压=5 V；角色=输出；组合=单口。适用于记录表A及记录表B。", "namespace": "report", "source_role": "report_context", "source_path": "output/pdf/rag-gain-dev-v0.1/SYND-805.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "报告前置说明", "version": "1", "publication_status": "active", "material_type": "synthetic", "allowed_roles": ["engineer"], "task_id": "DEVTASK-805", "conditions": {"voltage_v": 5, "electrical_role": "输出", "combination": "单口"}, "context_ids": []}
